{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAutomationAttr\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkDeprecatedAutomationAttr</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName </span><span class=\"fn\">attrName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">removal?</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Hint.html#Lean.Meta.Hint.Suggestion\">Meta.Hint.Suggestion</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reports that `declName` is deprecated but tagged with `attrName` at `ref`, where `attrName` adds\ndeclarations to a set used by automation (see `isAutomationAttr`). Automation uses such declarations\nwithout a deprecation warning, so the hint offers `removal?` to remove the attribute.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAutomationAttr","kind":"def","line":298,"name":"Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAutomationAttr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L298-L325"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkListRemovalSuggestion\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkListRemovalSuggestion</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">whole</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">elems</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/CoreM.html#Lean.Core.CoreM\">CoreM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Hint.html#Lean.Meta.Hint.Suggestion\">Meta.Hint.Suggestion</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a suggestion that removes `elems[i]` from the list `elems` in the source of `whole`, together\nwith the separator after it, or before it if it is the last element. If it is the only element, the\nsuggestion removes `whole` instead. Returns `none` if any of the syntax\nhas no position in the current file.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkListRemovalSuggestion","kind":"def","line":260,"name":"Lean.Linter.mkListRemovalSuggestion","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L260-L280"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAt\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkDeprecatedAt</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hint</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint\">DeprecationHint</a> := <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.ident\">DeprecationHint.ident</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reports a use of `declName` at `ref` if it is deprecated, unless deprecation checks are disabled at\n`ref` (see `Core.Context.checkDeprecated`).","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAt","kind":"def","line":250,"name":"Lean.Linter.checkDeprecatedAt","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L250-L258"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecated\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">checkDeprecated</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hint</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint\">DeprecationHint</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reports a use of `declName` at the current ref if it is deprecated. Callers should usually use\n`checkDeprecatedAt`, which respects `Core.Context.checkDeprecated`.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.checkDeprecated","kind":"def","line":207,"name":"Lean.Linter.checkDeprecated","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L207-L248"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkIdentHint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkIdentHint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">declName </span><span class=\"fn\">newName</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates the hint offered by `DeprecationHint.ident`: if the current ref is an identifier that\nresolves to `declName`, offers to replace it with the shortest name that resolves to `newName`.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkIdentHint","kind":"def","line":195,"name":"Lean.Linter.mkIdentHint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L195-L205"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkReplacementHint\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkReplacementHint</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ref</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">replacement</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#String\">String</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a hint that offers to replace `ref` by `replacement`. Returns the empty message if `ref`\nhas no source position.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.mkReplacementHint","kind":"def","line":187,"name":"Lean.Linter.mkReplacementHint","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L187-L193"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.custom\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">DeprecationHint</span>.<span class=\"name\">custom</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">mk</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Message.html#Lean.MessageData\">MessageData</a></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint\">DeprecationHint</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Appends the message computed from the name of the replacement, such as a hint for syntax other\nthan a plain identifier, or a note explaining why no hint is offered.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.custom","kind":"ctor","line":181,"name":"Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.custom","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L181-L185"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.ident\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">DeprecationHint</span>.<span class=\"name\">ident</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint\">DeprecationHint</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If the current ref is an identifier that resolves to the deprecated constant, offers to replace it\nwith the shortest name that resolves to the replacement.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.ident","kind":"ctor","line":176,"name":"Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.ident","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L176-L180"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.none\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Linter</span>.<span class=\"name\">DeprecationHint</span>.<span class=\"name\">none</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint\">DeprecationHint</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"No suggestion.","docLink":"./Lean/Linter/Deprecated.html#Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.none","kind":"ctor","line":174,"name":"Lean.Linter.DeprecationHint.none","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Linter/Deprecated.lean#L174-L175"}},{"header